          "type": "text",
          "text": "Student designers considered high daytime temperatures while preparing a replacement design for the public library sculpture. Visitors can walk around the sculpture but cannot touch it. A later inspection will compare the finished dimensions with this record. A rectangular pyramid has volume 270 cm³ and base dimensions 10 cm by 9 cm. Find its perpendicular height in cm."
        }
      ],
